    <name>VI-03 · Port Renfrew–Lake Cowichan dirt</name>
    <desc>The easier VIGL dirt stage between Port Renfrew and Lake Cowichan, distinct from the paved coastal road. Road geometry derived from OpenStreetMap contributors under ODbL; route selection is an independently authored research overview. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
